mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'><span style='mso-tab-count:1'>             </span>Batman<span
style='mso-tab-count:1'>                                     </span>&#304;stanbul<span
style='mso-tab-count:1'>                                       </span>A&#287;r&#305;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=3LMZA style='line-height:normal'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'><span style='mso-tab-count:1'>  </span>Mahmut
Celadet Gaydal&#305;<span style='mso-tab-count:1'>             </span>Ömer
